---
import PresentationLayout from "@components/PresentationLayout.astro";
---

<PresentationLayout title="做生意和投资" eyebrow="INVESTING · 投资本质" narrow>
  <div class="root">
    <p class="lead">投资，本质也是"倒卖一种特殊的商品"——只是你不需要进货、搬运、找客户，只需<strong>买入资产、等待时间证明你正确</strong>。</p>

    <div class="compareGrid">

      {/* 左栏：做生意 */}
      <div class="colCard">
        <div class="colHeader">
          <span class="colIcon">📦</span>
          <div>
            <p class="colEyebrow">BUSINESS · 做生意</p>
            <p class="colTitleRed">倒卖球鞋，每个环节都要操心</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flowCol">
          <div class="stepBox"><span class="stepIcon">💰</span><span class="stepLabel">低价买入</span></div>
          <div class="arrowDown">↓</div>
          <div class="tagRow">
            <div class="tagChip"><span class="tagChipIcon">📋</span><span class="tagChipLabel">进货</span></div>
            <div class="tagChip"><span class="tagChipIcon">🔍</span><span class="tagChipLabel">验货</span></div>
            <div class="tagChip"><span class="tagChipIcon">🗄️</span><span class="tagChipLabel">仓储</span></div>
            <div class="tagChip"><span class="tagChipIcon">🚚</span><span class="tagChipLabel">搬运</span></div>
            <div class="tagChip"><span class="tagChipIcon">📣</span><span class="tagChipLabel">找客户</span></div>
            <div class="tagChip"><span class="tagChipIcon">🤝</span><span class="tagChipLabel">谈判</span></div>
            <div class="tagChip"><span class="tagChipIcon">💳</span><span class="tagChipLabel">收款</span></div>
            <div class="tagChip"><span class="tagChipIcon">📦</span><span class="tagChipLabel">打包</span></div>
            <div class="tagChip"><span class="tagChipIcon">🚛</span><span class="tagChipLabel">发货</span></div>
            <div class="tagChip"><span class="tagChipIcon">🛠️</span><span class="tagChipLabel">售后</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="arrowDown">↓</div>
          <div class="stepBox"><span class="stepIcon">💵</span><span class="stepLabel">高价卖出</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 右栏：投资 */}
      <div class="colCard">
        <div class="colHeader">
          <span class="colIcon">💹</span>
          <div>
            <p class="colEyebrow">INVESTING · 投资</p>
            <p class="colTitleGreen">买一种"特殊商品"，什么都不用做</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flowCol">
          <div class="stepBox"><span class="stepIcon">💰</span><span class="stepLabel">买入</span></div>
          <div class="arrowDown">↓</div>
          <div class="stepBox"><span class="stepIcon">⏳</span><span class="stepLabel">等待</span></div>
          <div class="arrowDown">↓</div>
          <div class="stepBox"><span class="stepIcon">💵</span><span class="stepLabel">卖出</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="footerBar">
      <p class="footerText"><strong>本质 ·</strong> 做生意靠"劳动换差价"，投资靠"时间换收益"——两者赚的都是买卖价差，区别只在投入的是<strong>勤恳的劳动</strong>还是<strong>耐心的等待</strong>。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</PresentationLayout>

<style>
  /* ---- page-specific: 03-what-is-investment ---- */
  .root {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 2.5rem 1.2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .lead {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #555;
  }

  .compareGrid {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    width: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .colCard {
    min-height: 0;
    border: 1px solid #e2e2e2;
    background: #fafafa;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: left;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .colHeader {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .colIcon {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .colEyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #9ca3af;
    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
  }

  .colTitleRed {
    margin: 0.1rem 0 0 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #b91c1c;
  }

  .colTitleGreen {
    margin: 0.1rem 0 0 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #15803d;
  }

  .flowCol {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-around;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .stepBox {
    border: 1px solid #e2e2e2;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .stepIcon {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .stepLabel {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #444;
  }

  .arrowDown {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #9ca3af;
  }

  .tagRow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-around;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    width: 100%;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .tagChip {
    border: 1px solid #e2e2e2;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.55rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .tagChipIcon {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .tagChipLabel {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #444;
  }

  .footerBar {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    border-left: 3px solid #333;
    padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
    background: #fafafa;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .footerText {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>